{"id":"e9a3aa5f1d968e98","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-inner-hod-model.md","title":"ZFC Inner HOD Model","display":"df-zfc-inner-hod-model — ZFC Inner HOD Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-hod-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-hod-model"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-hod-model — ZFC Inner HOD Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-hod-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-hod-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-hod-model — ZFC Inner HOD Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28d48ac87f8f834a\" href=\"?note=28d48ac87f8f834a\" title=\"58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable\">58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOD}\">\\(\\operatorname{HOD}\\)</span> (hereditarily ordinal-definable universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28d48ac87f8f834a\" href=\"?note=28d48ac87f8f834a\" title=\"58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable\">58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerHodModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerHodModel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}hod\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerHodModel}_S(H) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{HOD})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}hod\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerHodModel}_S(H) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{HOD})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> is the definable class whose members are exactly the members of the already-defined HOD universe; no new unsourced heredity predicate is introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable","status":"resolved","id":"28d48ac87f8f834a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable]]","embed":false},{"targ